<!-- l4: decide:an application to attach, everything in place -->

**244.** An application to attach, everything in place means An application to attach a pension or income under section 9(1) where the court has made an order under this Act for payment of money is TRUE, there is a pension or income payable to the person against whom the order was made is TRUE, the pension or income is capable of being attached is TRUE and the person by whom the pension or income is payable has been given an opportunity of being heard is TRUE.

